# two nights and a bit, the clock at 2x: nobody plays badly. No event in the words of 1.1's mishaps and quarrels
# (a string, a refusal, a stand-off, a storm-out, drink), every note the band plays in the tune's key, every backing
# note in the bar's chord; sets run straight on into new keys, parts are traded; the night builds and winds down;
# no peak near clipping all the while. What the band played, a bar a line, goes to notes.txt; the Night setting
wait 300
timewarp 2
peakreset
notelog app/build/scenarios/session/notes.txt
wait 1200000
notelog off
expect night 1
expect playing_n >0
expect badev 0
expect offkey 0
expect offchord 0
expect notes >3000
shot midnight.png
wait 2900000
expect night >2
expect mem >1
expect segues >0
expect trades >0
expect badev 0
expect logbad 0
expect offkey 0
expect offchord 0
expect xfields 0
expect peak_db_max -1
tap ENV
wait 200
shot regulars.png
tap ARP
wait 200
shot nights.png
# Night: how long a night takes, 20 minutes to 2 hours (on the Setup page)
tap GLO
wait 100
turn K4 -6
wait 200
expect nightlen 0
turn K4 9
wait 200
expect nightlen 5
shot setup.png
